    "the DCA rail (12 tranches, 10x, breakeven TP, resting invalidation) owns position size, so the record's leverage ladder and AUM-scaled lot sizing are not reproduced",
    "funding is charged on every settlement inside the hold with its truth_status disclosed (official vs modeled_funding) and never re-labelled"
  ]
}
